# class: architecture-fr
# schema: id | title | summary | source
# source: docs/architecture.md
# recipe: builtin:architecture

FR-01 | Real-time matrix by service | One row per service; per-(service,environment) slot showing current state | @docs/architecture.md#4-functional-requirements
FR-02 | Slot fields | Slot shows version, status (success/in-progress/failure), actor, elapsed-time, run-link | @docs/architecture.md#4-functional-requirements
FR-03 | Split-state slot | When current is in-progress or failed, slot also shows lastSuccessful below | @docs/architecture.md#4-functional-requirements
FR-04 | Per-slot history drawer | Full deployment history per slot exposed on-demand | @docs/architecture.md#4-functional-requirements
FR-05 | Push ingest API | POST /api/deployments accepts service,environment,version,status,run_url,run_number,actor | @docs/architecture.md#4-functional-requirements
FR-06 | Zero-change CI/CD integration | Notify step requires only adding one step to existing pipelines | @docs/architecture.md#4-functional-requirements
FR-07 | Filtering | Filter by service-name and by failure-state-only | @docs/architecture.md#4-functional-requirements
FR-08 | Live update no-reload | All connected browsers receive live updates on ingest without page reload | @docs/architecture.md#4-functional-requirements
FR-09 | Dynamic services/envs | No hardcoded service/env lists; derived from stored data | @docs/architecture.md#4-functional-requirements
FR-10 | Write API auth | POST /api/deployments authenticates every write with API key; 401 on missing/invalid | @docs/architecture.md#4-functional-requirements
FR-11 | (v2.0) Desktop notification client | OS notifications on slot state-change; click-through to dashboard | @docs/architecture.md#4-functional-requirements
FR-12 | (CR-0002) Four named views + attribute picker | Detailed/Compact/Glance/Focus views with per-view attribute picker | @docs/cr/CR-0002-four-named-views-and-attribute-picker.md
FR-13 | (CR-0003) Tree topology + layout axis | Per-service tree topology + Matrix/Swim-lane/Workflow-rows layouts (Matrix deferred to Phase 2 per CR-0007) | @docs/cr/CR-0003-tree-topology-and-layout-axis.md
FR-14 | (CR-0004) Optional ref + sha | Optional ref and sha fields on deployment payload | @docs/cr/CR-0004-ref-and-sha-optional-fields.md
FR-15 | (CR-0005) ref/sha display + topology axes | ref/sha as Display picker options + Topology correlation options | @docs/cr/CR-0005-ref-sha-display-and-topology.md
FR-16 | (CR-0006) Light/Dark/Auto theme | Theme axis: light/dark/auto; default auto; localStorage-persisted | @docs/cr/CR-0006-light-dark-auto-theme.md
FR-17 | (CR-0008) API validation + ProblemDetails + OpenAPI + Scalar | Length-only validation, RFC-7807 errors, OpenAPI spec, Scalar UI | @docs/cr/CR-0008-api-validation-and-openapi-scalar.md
